<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n64262" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λυτ-ικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>able to loose, laxative</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς κοιλίας</span> Mnesith. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				3.92c
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				91b
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λ. φάρμακα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					949a5
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λ. φάρμακον</span>
			<i>antidote</i> to a poison, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				9.16.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φάρμακον φλεγμονῆς λ.</span>
			<i>dispersive</i> of inflammation, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				11.751
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				10.637
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>able to refute, confutative</i>, of arguments, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1403a25
			</span></i>.</div>
